  "provenance_notes": {
    "sequential_dht_scope": "In JLISwift 0.6.0, per-scan DHT selection was added in its new caller-storage core (Sources/JLISwift/Decoder/JLIBaselineCallerStorage.swift), while its legacy owned decoder (Sources/JLISwift/Decoder/JLIDecoder.swift) still selects the final merged dictionaries. In SwiftJLI, the public Decoder routes sequential DCT through JLIDecoder.decodeParsed; updating JLIDecoder.decodeParsed to prepare dcTables and acTables from scan.dcTables and scan.acTables aligns sequential DCT with MarkerReader.parse, JPEGCodec.validateDCT, ProgressiveDecoder.decodeScan and JLIDecoder.decodeLossless.",
    "xyb_icc_profile_bytes": 728
